<title>GERMANY: German Oct import prices rise 0.6 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German Oct import prices rise 0.6 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    Oct 96     Sept 96	Oct 95</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.6	  +0.7	 -0.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +1.6	  +0.3	 -0.2</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991)  98.2	  97.6	 96.7</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.2	  +0.1	 -0.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    UNCH	  -0.5	 +1.5</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 103.5	 103.3	103.5</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
